## Built-in structural syntax

No structural constructs are reserved.

## Built-in components

No components are registered in this profile.

## User-provided components

### `<Json>`

Render a value as JSON text. `<Json value={config} />` writes the JSON where you put it.

**Forms:** `<Json />`

#### Props

This component declares no individual props.

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {},
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

**Captures:** `value` — evaluated by the component itself, so these props are deliberately absent from the schema above.

**Returns:** text — the markdown this component renders.

```json
{
  "type": "string"
}
```

**Origin:** `@executablemd/core` (registered default)

### `<Cwd>`

Read the working directory. `<Cwd />` renders its path without adding a newline.

**Forms:** `<Cwd />`

#### Props

This component declares no individual props.

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {},
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

**Returns:** text — the markdown this component renders.

```json
{
  "type": "string"
}
```

**Origin:** `@executablemd/core` (registered default)

### `<File>`

Read or write a file. `<File path="notes.md" />` reads the content; `<File path="notes.md">…</File>` writes the content. The path is relative to the working directory.

**Forms:** `<File />`

#### Props

| Prop | Type | Required | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `path` | `string` | yes |  |

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "path": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "path"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

**Returns:** text — the markdown this component renders.

```json
{
  "type": "string"
}
```

**Origin:** `@executablemd/core` (protected component)

### `<Glob>`

List files by pattern. `<Glob include={["**/*.md"]} as="docs" />` matches paths relative to the working directory. The list is sorted. Directories and symbolic links are never results.

**Forms:** `<Glob />`

#### Props

| Prop | Type | Required | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `include` | `array` | yes |  |
| `exclude` | `array` | no |  |

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "include": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "minItems": 1
    },
    "exclude": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "default": []
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "include"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

**Returns:** a value — it renders nothing, and `as` binds what it returns.

```json
{
  "type": "array",
  "items": {
    "type": "string"
  }
}
```

**Origin:** `@executablemd/core` (registered default)

### `<Syntax>`

Inspect available components and control-flow constructs. `<Syntax />` lists the symbols available here; `<Syntax names={["Elicit"]} />` renders selected documentation.

**Forms:** `<Syntax />`

#### Props

| Prop | Type | Required | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `names` | `array` | no | Optional. Render complete references for these structural or component names instead of the list of available symbols. Entries render once each, in symbol order. |

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "names": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "uniqueItems": true,
      "description": "Optional. Render complete references for these structural or component names instead of the list of available symbols. Entries render once each, in symbol order."
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

**Returns:** text — the markdown this component renders.

```json
{
  "type": "string"
}
```

**Origin:** `@executablemd/core` (protected component)
